The Glassfort name and logo

The files glassfort-*.svg in this package contain the Glassfort logo. The
logo is not covered by the GPL-3.0-or-later or CC BY-SA 4.0 licences of the
Glassfort project. It may be used only as described in the Glassfort
trademark policy:

    https://github.com/jankln/GlassfortOS/blob/main/TRADEMARKS.md

Derived distributions must remove this package and use their own name and
logo.

The wordmark uses outlines of the typeface Inter by Rasmus Andersson,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://rsms.me/inter).
